     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A**
     A          R PFR01                     TEXT('EDI 148 Format')
     A            FRCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            FREXDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('EXTRACT DATE')
     A*
     A***    Transaction
     A*
     A            FRTSET    R    3A         REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      TEXT('TRANSACTION SET ID')
